Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}IV！ 做好忏悔的准备了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）干得漂亮 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）赢了 赢了 快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 不可能… 我竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然会输！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.89,0:01:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阳斗… 阳斗在哪里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪里！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 谁知道啊 那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.92,0:01:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就直接问你那腐朽的灵魂问个清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡回收不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们凭借这枚纹章的力量受到守护。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我记住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们会将所受痛苦的两倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给你……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）III。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）来吧，我们回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把哈鲁特还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人……都消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）哈鲁特的话，就在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，是那时候的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V：渴望哈鲁特大人之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟敢……竟敢骗我！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……为什么是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:04:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对哈鲁特……你对哈鲁特做了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必担心。他还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，他已经耗尽了力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……他把剩下的所有力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都给了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特：这次 换我来保护哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然会被哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……到底对哈鲁特做了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 一马先生的儿子吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？为什么你会知道我爸的事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的父亲还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在星光体世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸可能还活着……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是怎么回事啊？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸还活着……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我爸在星光体世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说 星光体世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你来的那个世界吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 那里会有老爸在啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。我的记忆……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 只要收集 No.卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等你的记忆恢复之后……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隼人他…… 那家伙生病了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 你就是为了隼人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被强迫去战斗的可怜士兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了弟弟把灵魂卖给了恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隼人治不好……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 如果 隼人能治好的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命是摧毁星光体世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那个叫星光体世界的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果有老爸在的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！ 真是的 我搞不懂了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 我该怎么办才好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！老爸他说不定还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸他！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游…游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不像你的风格啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能让你再往前走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.37,0:08:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，由我来保护。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能让你们对哈鲁特为所欲为！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）住手，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）就算你待在哈鲁特身边，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也什么都做不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在只能交给心园先生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马身上有 No.卡的原版
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附身这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明明知道，为什么一直不说？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:08:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:08:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙，由我来猎。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得真好听。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们俩亲密地打双人决斗我可是知道的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是打得挺起劲的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是我的猎物。打倒他的是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有 No.卡的人，全都是我的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你要挡在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你也是我的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）哈特……哦哦，哈特……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是我的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈特……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）费卡大人的悲叹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}悲伤 我深表理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是谁 夺走了哈鲁特的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）据快斗的报告{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有奇怪纹章的那帮人干的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些人迟早{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会在决斗嘉年华决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:09:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。 那么就把那些家伙撕成碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 一定要从他们那里把哈鲁特的力量夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要去那个叫星光体世界的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亲手把老爸只能由我亲手去找到他。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那Numbers呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的意思是Numbers的事无所谓了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是老爸…老爸他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定还活着啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就先放过我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）你这身打扮是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算离家出走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是离家出走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐，你别吓着。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是说爸可能还活着那件事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从小鸟酱那里听说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要去找爸把他带回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，你这个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸可是去了世界的尽头去找了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我也要去世界的尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把老爸找出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是世界的尽头还是星光体世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都绝对要找到。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 老爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这儿 在这儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）好久不见了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你是要抛弃决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可爱的徒弟听说你在努力修行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就坐不住了本以为下山来看看{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果就碰上这场骚动。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过没想到还有这样的内情啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能理解我，我就放心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那，我走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要不要来一场？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷，不好意思，我现在没心情决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是你师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你这么轻易就放弃决斗的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你非去不可
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就先打倒我再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了，我接受挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，抱歉，这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没办法帮你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 我一个人就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 爷爷！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR视觉链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）哈鲁特的力量正在我体内开始觉醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我的场地上就有5只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷那边是1只里侧守备怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合就决出胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我女孩 攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我推击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家也上！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神圣防护罩 反射镜力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽全灭了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过急于分出胜负竟然轻视了对手的盖牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！不过还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是我占优势！回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，那老夫的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老夫将王后骑士反转召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着老夫通常召唤卫兵骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王 王后 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当国王与王后的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}齐聚场地之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能从卡组将杰克的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，卫兵骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气召唤了3只怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）怪兽三连击啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后一击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌发动魔法卡 融合！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绘札的三剑士啊 融合吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 拥有天位称号的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极融合剑士 阿尔卡纳 骑士小丑！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3800！？骗人的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就逆转了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！阿尔卡纳 骑士小丑！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…可恶！再来一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}急什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 现在的你根本赢不了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你 什么都没看在眼里！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可…可是啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我该怎么做才好我根本不知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是选星光体，还是选春人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我怎么可能决定得了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以你才逃了，对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以寻找父亲为名。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃走了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抛弃了劲敌，抛弃了朋友，连家人也抛弃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且连你的搭档都抛弃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的搭档一定也是这么想的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，好好看看你的脚下。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的脚下牢牢扎根着决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，就直面决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，从那里迈出第一步。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那前方，必定有你的父亲在。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为，决斗正是因为你和你父亲的羁绊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷 我… 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 果然还是喜欢决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最喜欢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）好厉害… 好厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算拥有纹章的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要控制它竟然这么难！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡 快了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你所期望的这份力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你轰飞到异世界去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着吧。 等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷 现在的我能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是赢下决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得没错 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在嘉年华上夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让心园先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你建一座
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铜像什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，爷爷，那个心园先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么来头？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）那还用说嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正如其名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是心园的象征，孩子们的人气王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这我早就知道了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是象征、是人气王这事我是知道的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但不是这个意思啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有表就有里。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有光的地方就有影。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生……据说他的背后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有黑幕在操控。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑幕！？什么啊？那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}百年一遇的天才
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被称为科学家的费克博士。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是黑幕？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个充满谜团的人物啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（六十郎）他现在是活着还是已经死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}建立起心园市的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.03,0:20:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据说就是Ｄｒ．费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而那个费卡正是一马最后引导的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的父亲和那个叫费卡的人物。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　Ｍｒ．心园
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和他们有所关联的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在我迈出的　那前方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸一定　就在那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了这个　我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗嘉年华中　务必　赢到最后》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？　刚才那个少年？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的　九十九游马正是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的原持有者。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.75,0:21:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九一马的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 不可能发生…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙就是 来自星光体界的使者…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要放那张卡的话刚才那个就不需要了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说有就是 有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 就用那里的陷阱来掩护比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里的 是哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里啊 那里。 那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 要赢啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然。

